This is how to find any revisions on the php ports:

git status | sed -nE 's@^[[:space:]]*modified:[[:space:]]+(\.\./\.\./bucket_[^/]{2}/php8[0-9]-[^/]+/).*@\1specification@p' | sort -u | xargs -r grep -H REVISION



Generic version:
git status | sed -nE 's@^[[:space:]]*modified:[[:space:]]+(\.\./\.\./bucket_[^/]{2}/.+/).*@\1specification@p' | sort -u | xargs -r grep -H REVISION
